 -- openmediavault-sunburstfs plugin <chutchens91@gmail.com>  Mon, 11 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

openmediavault-sunburstfs (7.0~phase0-3) stable; urgency=low

  * The <img> and hint/sanitizeHtml path rendered, but the image
    itself was corrupt ("contains errors" in-browser). Root cause:
    inline `content` bytes cross the IPC boundary between omv-engined
    (where the RPC method runs) and download.php (a separate php-fpm
    worker) and don't survive intact as raw binary. Switched to
    `filepath` + explicit chmod 0644, matching core's rrd.inc.

